  "description": "Siblings with personalities and tastes as different as night and day: Cheon-Jae and Man-Jae. Unlike Cheon-Jae, whose social skills are maxed out, Man-Jae's only friend is the youngest cat, Baek-Jae.\n\n *“With no one to meet but books, I can't help but study well!”*\n\nCheon-Jae schemes to find Man-Jae a friend, while Baek-Jae watches it all with disdain...\n\nOne cat, two humans. The chaotic and delightful daily life of three siblings!\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
